\[
a_{n+1} + 2 = a_n^3 + 5a_n^2 + 10a_n + 8 = (a_n^2 + 3a_n + 4)(a_n + 2),
\]
or
\begin{align*}
\frac{2^n(a_n + 1)}{a_n^2 + 3a_n + 4} &= \frac{2^n(a_n^2 + 3a_n + 2)}{a_{n+1} + 2} 
&= \frac{2^n(a_n^2 + 3a_n + 4)}{a_{n+1} + 2} - \frac{2^n\cdot 2}{a_{n+1} + 2} 
&= \frac{2^n}{a_n + 2} - \frac{2^{n+1}}{a_{n+1} + 2}.
\end{align*}
Sum telescopes.  Answer  $\boxed{\tfrac{1}{2026}}$ .

